            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Susan Smith"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The coconut burnt well before 5min was up, so I pulled it out early. I was expecting the brown sugar to crisp up...no such luck. I won't make it again. The fresh pineapple was better with it's natural sweetness.",
            "datePublished": "2009-05-11T17:22:53.977Z"
