              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Zoeden"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Mmmmmm. I can see how this would be absolutely delicious with Vanilla ice cream on the side, but it is fabulous just on it's own. A quick easy treat to satisfy a sweet tooth. Love it. I didn't get fancy with presentation. I cut up a fresh pineapple into a small baking pan and then sprinkled with the brown sugar and coconut. Easy to scoop out as an ice cream sundae topping....though Ive just been eating it out of the pan. lol",
